          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Autodesk's December 2023 implementation uses Scheduled Triggers for recurring token-document maintenance and warns that processing hundreds of users can time out; this is implementation evidence, not a materialized-view performance benchmark. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://aps.autodesk.com/blog/maintaining-refresh-tokens-mongodb-triggers",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a66e9c717d5ccdbcd8daa4dc5a9bc5a0cf2dfb4da04985d29f1fa6d0f3c9bb1f",
