          ],
          "also": [
            "https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-03-31-mongodb-atlas-scheduled-triggers-cron/view"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atlas Scheduled Triggers use five-field cron evaluated in UTC; '* * * * *' schedules every minute, and '0 11 * * *' schedules daily at 11:00 AM UTC. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-ui/triggers/scheduled-triggers.md",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-ui/triggers/scheduled-triggers.md",
