      "title": "Measurements and reference values",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The Atlas Functions documentation caps a request at 300 seconds and memory use at 350 MB. Triggers inherit Function constraints; a refresh scheduler does not remove those limits. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)",
