    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Atlas evaluates documented cron schedules in UTC with five fields: minute, hour, day of month, month, and weekday. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-ui/triggers/scheduled-triggers.md",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-ui/triggers/scheduled-triggers.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:607691479c662eb274761b4dc7e662da2ed6f95ab96888f6cc5f778ba345e5a2",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:34fcc0d3b3aa3c58638fffaa0ffd990c90f1e4dc2a4aa039c727ef53d74a0c09",
            "ev:eac30f67a591e56c13b034593a300f8a5bff90bb1c4277c6f7ee937eb9209fb6"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://cris.unibo.it/bitstream/11585/978274/3/ICBDBI2024-Accepted.pdf"
          ],
          "remediation": {
            "claim_id": "clm:1824c69ffb20071460c3404edbbb118d9d235d9de0f9a0e46217a698e6bf946c",
            "outcome": "CORRECTED",
            "at": "2026-11-02T11:44:48Z"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The cron expression */25 * * * * fires at minutes 0, 25, and 50 each hour; it does not produce uniformly spaced 25-minute refreshes across the hour boundary. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-ui/triggers/scheduled-triggers.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:fa2515da91c56ebde8ade93f020d629330e35eadae77e0c07c63e019e7e72b99",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:34fcc0d3b3aa3c58638fffaa0ffd990c90f1e4dc2a4aa039c727ef53d74a0c09"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The 2024 paper proposes adding seconds and year fields to support one-off events and explicitly states that it does not implement a new Atlas version. Its seven-field examples must not be treated as shipped Atlas syntax. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://cris.unibo.it/bitstream/11585/978274/3/ICBDBI2024-Accepted.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:fb233125e67abd46f98264e7f5a3ebb9fe877948b8668c1a7e4c8ecffff83691",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:412818a41e1064d3e4ad3a2bb77236f43c2151474a2f6c3403c5aad1f827322e"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atlas Functions are capped at 300 seconds of runtime per request, after which a Function will time out and fail. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-ui/triggers/functions.md",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-ui/triggers/functions.md",
          "note": null,
