          }
        },
        {
          "text": "OneUptime's March 2026 example aggregates a UTC daily window and upserts summaries by date and category. This illustrates replacing the same window's values on rerun; it does not prove complete late-arrival or deletion handling. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-03-31-mongodb-atlas-scheduled-triggers-cron/view",
